<section class="lg-sec" id="annex-1" aria-labelledby="annex-1-h">
  <h3 class="lg-sec__h" id="annex-1-h"><span class="lg-sec__n">A1.</span> Description of processing activities for Customer Personal Data<a class="lg-anchor" href="#annex-1" aria-label="Link to Annex 1">#</a></h3>
  <p class="lg-short"><b>In short.</b> What data we process, about whom, and why.</p>
  <div class="lg-body">
    <p>This Annex sets out details of the Processing of Customer Personal Data by Voqalize in connection with the Services.</p>
    <h4>1. List of parties</h4>
    <div class="lg-table-wrap">
      <table class="lg-table lg-table--kv">
